Business Recommendations
Capitalize on Chennai: Launch targeted loyalty rewards and expand delivery network coverage to maintain market leadership.

Turn Around Underperforming Metros: Conduct market research in Mumbai (₹17K) and Bangalore (₹21K) to resolve delivery or marketing bottlenecks.

Optimize Payment Gateways: Streamline debit card infrastructure to prevent drop-offs and introduce digital payment incentives to transition cash orders (₹31K) to UPI.
